WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Begin in Downward-Facing Dog.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Shift weight into the hands and left foot.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Inhale and lift the right leg high, toes pointing down.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the shoulders square; optionally open the hip and stack the right hip.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then lower and switch sides.
